          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "The collection made available for download here contains the running text from the transcriptions, collated into text files (one per inventory number). This means that headers, marginalia, page numbers, catch words and signatures are missing. The text of a new scan is always preceded by its file name.\n</p>\n<p> \nPlease note that the transcriptions will contain errors. They have not been manually checked for accuracy or completeness. Some labels, characterizations and information about persons, actions and events may be offensive and troubling to individuals and communities. Be careful when relying on these transcriptions and be aware of their limitations.\n</p>\n<p>\nThis is the first version (v0.1) of these transcriptions. Please share your feedback through the contact form on <a href=\"https://globalise.huygens.knaw.nl/contact-us/\" target=\"_top\">https://globalise.huygens.knaw.nl/contact-us/</a>. In the future, improved versions will be made available. \n</p>\n<p>\nLicense: CC0 (<a href=\"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0\" target=\"_top\">http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0</a>). You are free to build upon, enhance, and reuse the transcriptions for any purposes without restriction. Please reference the GLOBALISE project when using these transcriptions."
          },
